              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cammie Cantrell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is REALLY good punch. We used it for a Christian cooking class. Everyone loved it. I served once with slices of lemon, strawberries and oranges...VERY pretty.",
            "datePublished": "2004-11-22T13:15:16.750Z"
